                "text": "&lt;div class=&quot;dossierNote&quot; data-layer=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;dossierLayer&quot;&gt;Sources&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;dossierTitle&quot;&gt;Al Jadeed&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;A video of 18 December released by the Lebanese broadcaster: bags stored at bay 6 and around door 9, blocking the entrance.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;"
